### assistant: health (management-порт, внутри сети)
GET http://localhost:8084/actuator/health

### Вопрос по пакету
POST {{gateway}}/assistant/api/v1/packages/{{packageId}}/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "Почему не проходит сумма субсидии?"}

### История диалога
GET {{gateway}}/assistant/api/v1/packages/{{packageId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Подсказки вопросов
GET {{gateway}}/assistant/api/v1/packages/{{packageId}}/suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
